1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
My family is big and very loving.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
I have a father, a mother, two sisters, and one brother.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:19,000
We all live together in one big house in Addis Ababa.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Every morning, my mother prepares a delicious breakfast and fresh coffee.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:34,000
My father reads the news before going to work.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:42,000
My brother and I go to school together.

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000
When my sisters return from school, they do their homework.

8
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:57,000
In the evening, we all gather around one table and eat dinner.

9
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Talking about our day, we laugh a lot and play together.

10
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,000
I love my family more than anything.
